WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Leading a section.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.000
As a section lead, Today puts your section first:

3
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.887
what’s unassigned, overdue, blocked, and waiting, and on what.

4
00:00:12.337 --> 00:00:14.398
See how many open commitments,

5
00:00:14.398 --> 00:00:17.567
undelivered orders and UMTs you’re carrying.

6
00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:22.938
Workload shows who holds what, beside what each count means.

7
00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:25.595
Counts never measure effort.

8
00:00:25.595 --> 00:00:28.718
And zero recorded is never zero work.
